  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(a + b + c) = 17, and (a2 + b2 + c2) = 101\n\n**Formula used:**\n\n(a + b + c)² = (a2 + b2 + c2) + 2 (ab + bc +ca)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(a + b + c)2 = (a2 + b2 + c2) + 2 (ab + bc +ca)\n\n⇒ 17² = 101 + 2 (ab + bc +ca)\n\n⇒ (ab + bc +ca) = 94\n\n (a - b)2 + (b - c)2 + (c - a)2.\n\n⇒ 2 (a2 + b2 + c2) - 2 (ab + bc +ca)\n\n⇒ 101 × 2 - 2 × 94 = 14",
